How to Apply This License to Your Work

  To apply this License, attach the following notice to the work, with
the fields filled in, and ship the full text of this License alongside
it as a file named LICENSE:

    <one line with the work's name and a brief idea of what it does.>
    Copyright (C) <year> <name of author>

    This work is licensed under The Last Resort License, Version 1.
    You may not deploy it where a deliberate crash could cost lives,
    and you may not remove, soften, or outrun its warnings. See the
    LICENSE file for the full terms.

  If your work also terminates processes or crashes systems on
purpose, consider whether its users deserve a license that says so out
loud. Most of them do.
